    "northStar": "Annotated casebook",
    "overview": "The user selected a technical casebook rather than a conventional SaaS world. Reading is the primary activity: an entry, its source, a written response, and the provenance of the reference should remain distinct. The interface uses a contents shoulder and outside annotations, not a marketing hero or dashboard illustration.",
